MTD	title	Mouse adrenal gland lipidomics (fads2 vs WT)
MTD	description	Untargeted LC-MS lipidomics profiling of mouse adrenal gland tissue comparing B6-fads2/J and C57BL/6J genotypes; positive ion mode. Processed by MS-DIAL with Blank-category samples retained.
